    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Sensations",
     "texto": [
      "**Amețeală** means \"dizziness\"; **senzație de arsură**, \"burning sensation\". Names of symptoms do not on their own indicate a diagnosis."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Changes",
     "texto": [
      "**Se agravează** means \"gets worse\" and **se ameliorează**, \"gets better\". You can describe the change without claiming what its cause is."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
